<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="it">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Italiano con Sara 🌸 — Imperativo Gentile</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:ital,wght@0,300;0,600;1,300&family=DM+Sans:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root { --sand: #f5efe6; --warm: #e8d9c4; --terracotta: #c4714a; --sea: #4a7f8f; --dark: #2a2018; --correct: #5a9e6b; --wrong: #c45a4a; }
  body { font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; background: var(--sand); color: var(--dark); line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; }
  .header { background: var(--dark); color: var(--sand); padding: 2.5rem 2rem; text-align: left; }
  .header h1 { font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-size: 2.2rem; margin: 0; }
  .header h1 em { color: var(--terracotta); font-style: italic; }
  .container { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 2rem 1.5rem; }
  .theory-card { background: white; border-radius: 16px; padding: 2rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; border: 1px solid var(--warm); box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); }
  .ex-card { background: white; border-radius: 16px; padding: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; border: 1px solid var(--warm); }
  .verb-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1rem; margin: 1rem 0; }
  .verb-box { background: var(--sand); padding: 1rem; border-radius: 12px; border-left: 4px solid var(--terracotta); }
  .choice-btn { background: var(--sand); border: 2px solid var(--warm); border-radius: 8px; padding: 0.5rem 1rem; cursor: pointer; margin: 5px; transition: 0.2s; }
  .choice-btn:hover { border-color: var(--terracotta); }
  .choice-btn.correct { background: #eef6f0; border-color: var(--correct); color: #3a7a4a; }
  .choice-btn.wrong { background: #fdf0ee; border-color: var(--wrong); color: #8a3030; }
  .feedback { margin-top: 1rem; padding: 10px; border-radius: 8px; display: none; }
  input { border: 2px solid var(--warm); border-radius: 8px; padding: 8px; width: 150px; }
  .speaking-prompt { background: var(--dark); color: white; padding: 20px; border-radius: 12px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="header">
  <div style="color: var(--sea); letter-spacing: 0.2em; font-size: 0.7rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">UNITÀ 11 · SICUREZZA</div>
  <h1>Imperativo di<br><em>Cortesia</em></h1>
</div>

<div class="container">
  <div class="theory-card">
    <h2>📖 Teoria: Comandare con Eleganza</h2>
    <p>Come skipper, devi dare ordini chiari. Con i clienti usiamo la forma <strong>Lei</strong>. Guarda come cambiano i verbi:</p>
    <div class="verb-grid">
      <div class="verb-box"><strong>Verbi in -ARE</strong><br><em>Sedere → Si sied<strong>A</strong></em><br><em>Entrare → Entr<strong>I</strong></em></div>
      <div class="verb-box"><strong>Verbi in -ERE / -IRE</strong><br><em>Tenere → Si teng<strong>A</strong></em><br><em>Salire → Salg<strong>A</strong></em></div>
    </div>
    <p>💡 <strong>Nota:</strong> I verbi riflessivi (sedersi, tenersi) mettono il "Si" davanti.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="ex-card">
    <h3>🎯 Esercizio 1: Situazioni d'emergenza</h3>
    <p>C'è un'onda improvvisa. Cosa dici al cliente?</p>
    <div id="choices-1">
      <button class="choice-btn" onclick="checkMC(this, true)">"Si sieda subito!"</button>
      <button class="choice-btn" onclick="checkMC(this, false)">"Siediti ora!"</button>
      <button class="choice-btn" onclick="checkMC(this, false)">"Si siede!"</button>
    </div>
    <div id="fb-1" class="feedback"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="ex-card">
    <h3>✏️ Esercizio 2: Trasforma il comando</h3>
    <p>1. (Tenersi) forte: <input type="text" id="inp1"> al corrimano.</p>
    <p>2. (Fare) attenzione: <input type="text" id="inp2"> al boma!</p>
    <button class="choice-btn" style="background:var(--terracotta); color:white;" onclick="checkFill()">Controlla</button>
    <div id="fb-2" class="feedback"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="speaking-prompt">
    <h3>🗣️ Sfida per Sara: Il temporale</h3>
    <p><em>"Sara! I'm scared, what should I do?"</em></p>
    <p>Rispondi al cliente usando: <strong>Si sieda</strong>, <strong>Si tenga</strong>, <strong>Stia calmo</strong> e <strong>Non si muova</strong>.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<script>
function checkMC(btn, isCorrect) {
  const fb = document.getElementById('fb-1');
  fb.style.display = "block";
  if(isCorrect) {
    btn.classList.add('correct');
    fb.innerHTML = "✅ Esatto! Usiamo 'Si sieda' per essere professionali.";
    fb.style.color = "var(--correct)";
  } else {
    btn.classList.add('wrong');
    fb.innerHTML = "❌ Troppo informale o grammaticalmente errato.";
    fb.style.color = "var(--wrong)";
  }
}

function checkFill() {
  const r1 = document.getElementById('inp1').value.toLowerCase().trim();
  const r2 = document.getElementById('inp2').value.toLowerCase().trim();
  const fb = document.getElementById('fb-2');
  fb.style.display = "block";
  if(r1 === "si tenga" && r2 === "faccia") {
    fb.innerHTML = "🎉 Bravissima Sara! 'Si tenga' e 'Faccia' sono perfetti.";
    fb.style.color = "var(--correct)";
  } else {
    fb.innerHTML = "⚠️ Controlla: 'Si teng...' e 'Facci...'";
    fb.style.color = "var(--wrong)";
  }
}
</script>
</body>
</html>
